<div id="content-left-wrapper">
    <div id="content-left">
        <div id="intro" class="box">
            <h2>AUR Home</h2>
            <p>
                Welcome to the <strong>{{ site.title }}</strong>!
                This repository provides automated package builds for Arch Linux, compiled in clean <code>archlinux:base-devel</code> containers using <code>makepkg</code> via GitHub Actions, signed with GPG, and published to our pacman repository.
            </p>
            <p>
                Please read the <a href="https://wiki.archlinux.org/title/AUR_User_Guidelines" target="_blank" rel="noopener">AUR User Guidelines</a> for more information and the <a href="https://wiki.archlinux.org/title/Arch_Packaging_Standards" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Arch Packaging Standards</a> for PKGBUILD specifications.
            </p>
            <p class="important">
                DISCLAIMER: AUR packages are user produced content. Any use of the provided files is at your own risk.
            </p>
            <p class="readmore">
                <a href="/packages/">View all packages...</a>
            </p>
        </div>

        <div id="getting-started" class="box">
            <h2>Getting Started</h2>
            <p>
                This is a GPG-signed <a href="https://wiki.archlinux.org/title/Pacman" target="_blank" rel="noopener">pacman</a> binary repository. Unlike the AUR itself, packages here install directly; no local build is required.
            </p>

            <h4>1. Add the repository</h4>
            <p>Append the following section to <code>/etc/pacman.conf</code>:</p>
            <pre><code>[akaere]
SigLevel = Required
Server = https://repo.lilithya.su/archlinux/$arch</code></pre>

            <h4>2. Import the signing key</h4>
            <p>Download the repository public key, add it to pacman's keyring, and locally sign it:</p>
            <pre><code>curl -fO https://repo.lilithya.su/akaere.gpg
sudo pacman-key --add akaere.gpg
fingerprint="$(gpg --show-keys --with-colons akaere.gpg |
  awk -F: '$1 == "fpr" { print $10; exit }')"
sudo pacman-key --lsign-key "$fingerprint"</code></pre>

            <h4>3. Refresh and install</h4>
            <pre><code>sudo pacman -Syu
sudo pacman -S &lt;package-name&gt;</code></pre>
        </div>

        <div id="news">
            <h3><a>Support</a><span class="arrow"></span></h3>
            <h4>Package Requests</h4>
            <div class="article-content">
                <p>
                    There are three types of requests that can be filed in the <var>Package Actions</var> box on the package details page:
                </p>
                <ul>
                    <li><em>Orphan Request</em>: Request a package to be disowned, e.g. when the maintainer is inactive.</li>
                    <li><em>Deletion Request</em>: Request a package to be removed from the repository.</li>
                    <li><em>Merge Request</em>: Request a package to be merged into another one.</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
            <h4>Submitting Packages</h4>
            <div class="article-content">
                <p>
                    All package recipes are maintained via the <a href="{{ site.githubRepo }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Registry</a> repository.
                    Pull requests trigger automated dry-run builds and package file diff previews.
                </p>
            </div>
            <h4>Discussion &amp; Issues</h4>
            <div class="article-content">
                <p>
                    For questions, requests, or bug reports regarding packages or build infrastructure, please file an issue on our <a href="{{ site.githubRepo }}/issues" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Issue Tracker</a>.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<div id="content-right">
    <div id="pkgsearch" class="widget">
        <form id="pkgsearch-form" method="get" action="/packages/">
            <fieldset>
                <label for="pkgsearch-field">Package Search:</label>
                <input id="pkgsearch-field"
                       type="text"
                       name="K"
                       size="30"
                       maxlength="35"
                       autocomplete="off" />
            </fieldset>
        </form>
    </div>

    <div id="pkg-updates" class="widget box">
        <h3>
            Recent Updates
            <span class="more">
                (<a href="/packages/?SB=l&amp;SO=d">more</a>)
            </span>
        </h3>

        <table>
            <tbody>
                {% for item in updates %}
                <tr>
                    <td class="pkg-name">
                        <a href="/packages/{{ item.name }}/">
                            {{ item.name }} {{ item.version }}
                        </a>
                    </td>
                    <td class="pkg-date">
                        {{ item.date }}
                    </td>
                </tr>
                {% endfor %}
            </tbody>
        </table>
    </div>

    <div id="pkg-stats" class="widget box">
        <h3>Statistics</h3>
        <table>
            <tbody>
                <tr>
                    <td class="stat-desc">Packages</td>
                    <td>{{ stats.packages }}</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td class="stat-desc">Orphan Packages</td>
                    <td>{{ stats.orphan_packages }}</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td class="stat-desc">Packages added in the past 7 days</td>
                    <td>{{ stats.added_7_days }}</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td class="stat-desc">Packages updated in the past 7 days</td>
                    <td>{{ stats.updated_7_days }}</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td class="stat-desc">Packages updated in the past year</td>
                    <td>{{ stats.updated_year }}</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td class="stat-desc">Packages never updated</td>
                    <td>{{ stats.never_updated }}</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td class="stat-desc">Registered Users</td>
                    <td>{{ stats.registered_users }}</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td class="stat-desc">Package Maintainers</td>
                    <td>{{ stats.package_maintainers }}</td>
                </tr>
            </tbody>
        </table>
    </div>

    <div id="my-stats" class="widget box">
        <h3>My Statistics</h3>
        <table>
            <tbody>
                <tr>
                    <td><a href="/packages/?SeB=m&amp;K=Lilithya">Packages</a></td>
                    <td>{{ stats.my_packages }}</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td><a href="/packages/?status=failed">Out of Date</a></td>
                    <td>{{ stats.my_outdated }}</td>
                </tr>
            </tbody>
        </table>
    </div>
</div>
